qishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004","text":"世祖詔舉士，竟陵王子良薦思遠及吳郡顧暠之、陳郡殷叡。邵陵王子貞爲吳郡，世祖除思遠爲吳郡丞，以本官行郡事，論者以爲得人。以疾解職，還爲司徒諮議參軍，領錄事，轉黃門郎。出爲使持節、都督廣交越三州諸軍事、寧朔將軍、平越中郎將、廣州刺史。高宗輔政，不之任，仍遷御史中丞。臨海太守沈昭略贓私，思遠依事劾奏，高宗及思遠從兄晏、昭略叔父文季請止之，思遠不從，案事如故。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0009","surface":"子良","start":9,"end":11,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0012","surface":"思遠","start":12,"end":14,"person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0017","surface":"顧暠之","start":17,"end":20,"person_id":"5b7_7xs_ar0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0023","surface":"殷叡","start":23,"end":25,"person_id":"ceq_pnr_q0e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0029","surface":"子貞","start":29,"end":31,"person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_F","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0038","surface":"思遠","start":38,"end":40,"person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0135","surface":"沈昭略","start":135,"end":138,"person_id":"q2u_kqh_bt5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0141","surface":"思遠","start":141,"end":143,"person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0151","surface":"思遠","start":151,"end":153,"person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p004:m0155","